      <title>Ο Ακτινολόγος Γιώργος Δήμου νέος συνεργάτης του «ΥΓΕΙΑ Πτολεμαΐδας</title>
      <link>https://www.svouranews.gr/%ce%bf-%ce%b1%ce%ba%cf%84%ce%b9%ce%bd%ce%bf%ce%bb%cf%8c%ce%b3%ce%bf%cf%82-%ce%b3%ce%b9%cf%8e%cf%81%ce%b3%ce%bf%cf%82-%ce%b4%ce%ae%ce%bc%ce%bf%cf%85-%ce%bd%ce%ad%ce%bf%cf%82-%cf%83%cf%85%ce%bd%ce%b5/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25ce%25bf-%25ce%25b1%25ce%25ba%25cf%2584%25ce%25b9%25ce%25bd%25ce%25bf%25ce%25bb%25cf%258c%25ce%25b3%25ce%25bf%25cf%2582-%25ce%25b3%25ce%25b9%25cf%258e%25cf%2581%25ce%25b3%25ce%25bf%25cf%2582-%25ce%25b4%25ce%25ae%25ce%25bc%25ce%25bf%25cf%2585-%25ce%25bd%25ce%25ad%25ce%25bf%25cf%2582-%25cf%2583%25cf%2585%25ce%25bd%25ce%25b5</link>
